# Spartan Gaming

## The Most Complete Cross-Platform Game Streaming Framework

**Spartan Gaming** is a production-grade, open-source framework for building cross-platform game streaming experiences. Powered by WebRTC, WebTransport, and native platform bindings, Spartan enables low-latency game streaming across desktop, browser, mobile, and embedded environments.

---

## ✨ Features

### 🎮 **Core Streaming**
- **Low-latency WebRTC streaming** — H.264 video + Opus audio pipeline
- **WebTransport datagrams** — Supplementary media and control channel
- **Multi-transport support** — WebRTC, WebTransport, fallback pathways
- **Quality adaptation** — Dynamic bitrate/resolution adjustment with hysteresis
- **Session recovery** — Bounded authenticated handoff with expiration

### 🖥️ **Desktop & Electron**
- **Native desktop integration** — Linux/macOS/Windows capture and encoding
- **Electron app protocol** — `spartan-app://` scheme with bundled asset delivery
- **Auto-updater** — Electron updater contract for seamless updates
- **Tray & global shortcuts** — Full desktop integration
- **Security-hardened** — CSP, co-op, co-op policies, credential stripping

### 🎛️ **Input & Controller**
- **Multi-controller support** — Up to 8 player slots with policy enforcement
- **Haptic rumble** — Dual-rumble with bounded magnitudes
- **Native input adapters** — Windows SendInput, macOS CGEvent, Linux uinput
- **Virtual gamepad** — Browser gamepad, Linux uinput, Windows external driver
- **Advanced mappings** — Gyro, touchpad, trackpicks, adaptive triggers

### 🌐 **Network & Signaling**
- **Secure signaling** — WebSocket + WebTransport with ticket-based auth
- **TURN/STUN infrastructure** — Short-lived HMAC-derived credentials
- **Multi-tenant hosting** — Configurable max connections, rate limiting
- **Provider integration** — Official service and embedded embed flows

### 📦 **Package & Deploy**
- **Packaged desktop builds** — `electron-builder` configuration
- **Release pipelines** — Automated signing, verification, and distribution
- **Platform presets** — Android, iOS, Windows, macOS, Linux configurations
- **Archive management** — ZIP/TAR/GZip readers with integrity verification

